'''Kelvin Inverter''' is a {{Rare}} item. It is obtained as a {{Odds|r|nameonly=y}} drop from [[Inferno Demonlord]] {{SlayerTier|II}}+ with at least {{CollectionLink|Blaze Slayer III}}.

== Obtaining ==
The '''Kelvin Inverter''' can be dropped from {{Stier|2}} and higher Inferno Demonlords, if the player has {{Coll|Blaze Slayer LVL 3}} or higher.

;Drop Chances
*{{Stier|2}}: {{Green|2.82%}}
*{{Stier|3}}: {{Green|2.70%}}
*{{Stier|4}}: {{Green|2.54%}}

