== Trivia ==
The '''Kelvin Inverter''' references the the base unit for temperature in the International System of Units, the [[w:Kelvin|Kelvin]], because of the fact that it is used in the recipe for the {{Item|Entropy Suppressor}}, where Entropy means the quantity representing the unavailability of a system's <u>thermal energy</u> for conversion into mechanical work, and Suppressor means something to prevent something from happening (whereas here preventing the unavailability of a system's thermal energy).

